Impressive.

249
00:16:37,920 --> 00:16:39,020
What do you mean?

250
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:42,849
Your friends are doing much
better than I had ever expected.

251
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:46,037
In fact, they're close to
uncovering your ancient name.

252
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:47,061
How do you know?

253
00:16:47,360 --> 00:16:49,337
You said they're not a part of this.

254
00:16:49,420 --> 00:16:51,780
You've been spying on them, haven't you?

255
00:16:52,340 --> 00:16:53,560
I should have known.

256
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:54,960
Of course not.

257
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:57,980
Not that it matters, right?

258
00:16:58,640 --> 00:17:01,380
After all, the countdown
to my victory is on.

259
00:17:01,760 --> 00:17:04,000
The resurrection of Zork is near.

260
00:17:04,340 --> 00:17:06,634
And since we're approaching the climax,

261
00:17:06,900 --> 00:17:11,260
I think it's about time I added another
little twist to this game of ours.

262
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:19,937
These sides are uneven.

263
00:17:20,020 --> 00:17:22,260
But I'm about to change that.

264
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:25,500
What sort of wicked scheme
are you up to, Bakura?

265
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:27,720
You ought to know, Pharaoh.

266
00:17:28,340 --> 00:17:33,060
After all, I'm simply using a tactic I
learned from you earlier on in the game.

267
00:17:33,500 --> 00:17:34,620
And what's that?

268
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:37,959
Remember when you were
drained of all your strength?

269
00:17:38,140 --> 00:17:40,120
So your friend gave you a boost?

270
00:17:40,360 --> 00:17:42,480
We've come too far to turn back now.

271
00:17:42,900 --> 00:17:44,880
You and I are a team, remember?

272
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:46,720
This is incredible.

273
00:17:47,100 --> 00:17:49,117
I can feel my energy returning.

274
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:53,200
I forgot how strong my
bond with Yugi truly is.

275
00:17:56,080 --> 00:18:00,597
Although I didn't think of it at the
time, Pharaoh, two can play at that game.

276
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:01,520
Oh, no.

277
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:04,626
I'm going to bring back
a former pawn of mine.

278
00:18:05,080 --> 00:18:09,139
However, first I shall need to borrow
some strength from the outside.

279
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:12,180
So I call Kaiba.

280
00:18:13,280 --> 00:18:14,960
You can't do that.

281
00:18:17,900 --> 00:18:19,440
What's going on?

282
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,820
Hold on.

283
00:18:39,120 --> 00:18:42,760
This place looks familiar,
but I'm not sure why.

284
00:18:45,960 --> 00:18:49,200
You shall see, just as
soon as I borrow your soul!

285
00:18:58,500 --> 00:19:01,700
I must join my father now.

286
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:02,780
Yes, my son!

287
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:26,360
I must say, it's good to
be back in the game again.

288
00:19:26,660 --> 00:19:31,260
And it appears I'm just in time to
witness the grand finale, that is.

289
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:35,040
Featuring Zork, the Dark One,
in his long-awaited return.

290
00:19:35,440 --> 00:19:38,120
And the Barrow in his
farewell performance.
